OL,3,GNEWSASwindon Half Marathon 2026: What
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic disruption is expected on
OL,7,FSunday as the Swindon Half Marathon
OL,8,Freturns to the town for a second
OL,9,Fconsecutive year.
OL,11,FVarious roads in the town and
OL,12,Fsurrounding area will be closed from
OL,13,F08:00 BST, including Dorcan Way,
OL,14,FKingfisher Drive and The Ridgeway.
OL,16,FLike last year, the 13.1-mile (21km)
OL,17,Froute will begin and finish at Coate
OL,18,FWater Country Park, running through the
OL,19,Ftown's eastern suburbs before heading
OL,20,Fsouth beyond the M4 motorway via
OL,21,FWanborough, Badbury and Medbourne.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
