OL,3,GNEWSASwindon Half Marathon 2026: What
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FRunners will be raising money for
OL,7,FProspect Hospice, the event's charity
OL,8,Fof the year, with several other charity
OL,9,Fpartners.
